  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Linguistic and Intercultural Mediation for Emergency Actions and Information Management in the Italian Police Offices (LIME@)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Italy is continuing to support the Border Police Offices in Southern Italy by providing qualified cultural mediation support by ensuring continual training, deployment, and monitoring of the activities of 80 cultural mediators in the police offices in the South. In addition the project will provide support in the digitalization and upgrading of select border police information systems.</narrative>
  </description>
